  "evidence": "TEXT_D: Mandatory National Service at 18; Defence spending to 2.5% of GDP by 2030 and strong support for Ukraine; legal annual cap on work and family visas with Rwanda removals and faster returns; 8,000 extra neighbourhood police, tougher sentencing and new protest restrictions; clarify Equality Act to define sex as biological sex; Veterans Bill and expanded veterans’ support; NHS funding to rise above inflation with more doctors/nurses and expanded mental health and dentistry; tougher welfare sanctions after 12 months, fraud powers like HMRC. TEXT_A: Repeal recent protest laws; self‑ID for trans people and X passports; cancel Trident and dismantle the UK nuclear arsenal; end hostile environment, remove MIR, expand safe routes, abolish NRPF and widen family reunion; decriminalise personal drug possession and sex work; large redistributive measures (UC +£40/week, end sanctions, £15 minimum wage, wealth and carbon taxes, rent controls) and extensive public ownership; no new oil/gas and no nuclear, strong environmental protections.",
